  "overstatement": "not_asked",
  "summary": "The plan presents Rafael’s work as a seven-leaf analysis memo, moving from a question through evidence to an answer with thorough factual safeguards and accessibility provisions. Its greatest weakness is that the elaborate 3D choreography contributes little explanation beyond what the ordinary page already communicates."
